# Base origin of the BenchQ web app used for sign-in and API requests.
# The extension requests /api/* on this origin; Next.js rewrites those paths to BACKEND_URL.
# Use the deployed BenchQ web-app origin when building for another environment.
# The backend ALLOWED_ORIGINS must also include this extension's chrome-extension:// origin.
BENCHQ_URL=http://localhost:3000
# The Chrome Web Store build is `npm run build:store`: it reads .env.store (https://www.benchq.io), refuses a local or
# non-https address and any all-sites access. Change the live address there.
